{
  "_comment": "Deterministic UCSC replay for the full-GRCh38 track-loading Electron acceptance test. The catalog contains transcript, quantitative, and read leaves. The regional response is shaped like an official hg38 bigGenePred API response around SAMD11, but its contents are a compact test fixture. Catalog responses are the whole trackDb tree rather than trackLeavesOnly, so each grouping keeps the display name a reader sees; re-captured 2026-09-23.",
